msgstr "Тест Mathlib"

#: src/mathlib.c:959
#, c-format
msgid ""
"%s=%s states the thread count of every library that honors it, so a thread "
"benchmark measures the same count on every pass.  Unset it and restart to "
"benchmark thread counts."
